<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=548" title="View the profile of Ganodoar">Ganodoar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 7<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=548"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:the_hit_man80@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1221.msg12151#msg12151"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1221.msg12151#msg12151">Shattered Emerald of Corruption Business</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> October 28, 2004, 10:51:13 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Greetings to all you rangers out on RN. Yes an sk greeting rangers is totally unheard of and out of the blue. Anyways, I wanted to post to let RN rangers who need earthcaller still about my shattered emerald of corruption business. As most of you know the seoc is still a bit of a bottleneck for ranger epic 1.0 despite the patch that increased the drop rate. Let me tell you that the drop rate didn&#039;t improve THAT much!! It&#039;s still a pain to get one period!!<br /><br />If you are a ranger that is frustrated about having to camp hate or have camped to hate but do not want to suffer anymore agony, send me a tell in-game and I will personally camp a ranger stone for you. I can&#039;t guarantee I can get one asap but I can guarantee I will get one as soon as one drops. I charge 40k for mqs and if you don&#039;t like my price then go ahead and feel free to camp a ranger stone for yourself. 40k is fair considering the drop rate is still very rare on it and some people I am sure are willing to part with 40k instead of going to a plane where you might get little to no xp and might spend so many hours to no avail.<br /><br />You can also post a reply to my post too if you want me to camp a seoc as well. Even though I am KOS to the quest NPC there is a way to work around that faction problem. If you have any doubts about scams or anything just ask Laylina, the latest ranger customer who got her money&#039;s worth.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
