	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12165"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=418" title="View the profile of Domaris">Domaris</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 48<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.disorder.com/eq/domaris-avatar.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Wicked Warder<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=418"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1221.msg12165#msg12165"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1221.msg12165#msg12165">Re: Shattered Emerald of Corruption Business</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> October 28, 2004, 04:30:04 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Sorry but agree with Cae here, reminds me of the guy who used to camp named in Hate when it really was hard to get epic drops, then charge 60K give or take for the pieces. May have been a nice guy (did help out alot if people wiped etc) but people who were legitimately there for an epic piece for themselves having someone else race to it then offer to sell it to them...friggin jerk.<br /><br />Same thing really. Besides now that you don&#039;t even need epic 1.0 to finish 1.5 whats the point really.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
