					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12287"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=473" title="View the profile of Laylina">Laylina</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 26<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=473"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1221.msg12287#msg12287"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1221.msg12287#msg12287">Re: Shattered Emerald of Corruption Business</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> November 01, 2004, 07:53:48 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yeah, dont be hating.  I spent 6 hours in Hate trying to get that Stone and I honestly just didnt have time to do it anymore. Farming Anguish signets and AAs is a much more valuable use of my Time.  So if someone out there like Ganodar wants to do it for me, then hey I&#039;ll pay him =)  I was the one who posted on here first looking for someone to MQ for me, any of you could have sent me a tell but he was the one who did =)  Hell Ive had over 100k sitting in the bank doing nothing but buying me stat food for over a year, so I figured wth.  He was very polite and honest.  I would imagine a good many people have either provided or received a MQ, so chill on the guy.<br /><br />/hugs ganodar<br /><br /><br />.edit....oh and Ive wanted the Earthcaller forever, youd be amazed at how often you dont have a slower around.&nbsp; It helps a ton.&nbsp; Has nothing to do with epic 1.5.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
