	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13375"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=827" title="View the profile of chakachakkaa">chakachakkaa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 9<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://venus.walagata.com/w/elburro/GnollheadbeerA17.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Gnoll Head say hi<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=49931248" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=49931248&amp;img=5" alt="49931248" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=827"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1221.msg13375#msg13375"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1221.msg13375#msg13375">Re: Shattered Emerald of Corruption Business</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #8 on:</b> December 22, 2004, 03:56:12 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Frikky is right. I had been in hate the last couple days working on marsinger quest and if you are killing the 2 named/ph(eiree chest/ire lord) just south of the zone in it drops alot. I think 40k is just way to much to even offer to sell an item that drops this frequently and in no way is &quot;its only fair&quot; price. using the map here <a href="http://eq.chedrock.com/Hate_b_Tier1.gif" target="_blank">http://eq.chedrock.com/Hate_b_Tier1.gif</a> camping the places marked 5 and 11 will get you this in a few hours. Also just camping hate can be really financially productive now that you can turn in most quest armor pieces and get peridots, diamonds or blue diamonds for them to/from appropriate guildmasters in PoK.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
