							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=650514" target="_blank"><img src="http://venus.walagata.com/w/elburro/SigningofDeclarationofGnollHead01e.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><span style="color: lime;">I hate to advocate drugs, alcohol, violence or insanity to anyone, but they&#039;ve always worked for me - HST(1937-2005) </span>
						</td>
